WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.817 --> 00:00:05.720
Stannis Baratheon: What are you reading?
Shireen Baratheon: The Dance of Dragons.&nbsp;

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:09.200
Stannis: What’s it about?
Shireen: It’s the story of the fight between&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:14.320
Rhaenyra Targaryen and her half-brother Aegon&nbsp;
for control of the Seven Kingdoms. Both of them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:18.720
thought they belonged on the Iron Throne. When&nbsp;
people started declaring for one of them or the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:24.400
other, their fight divided the kingdoms in two.&nbsp;
Brothers fought brothers, dragons fought dragons.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:33.040
By the time it was over, thousands were dead.&nbsp;
And it was a disaster for the Targaryens as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:37.840
well. They never truly recovered.
Stannis: The Dance of Dragons.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:43.840
Why is that a dance?
Shireen: It’s just what they call it.&nbsp;

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:47.280
Stannis: Hmm. Doesn’t make much sense.
Shireen: I think it’s poetic.&nbsp;

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:56.720
Stannis: If you’d had to choose&nbsp;
between Rhaenyra and Aegon,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.720 --> 00:00:59.680
who would you have chosen?
Shireen: I wouldn’t have chosen either.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:02.000
It’s all the choosing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:11.840
sides that made everything so horrible.
Stannis: Sometimes a person has to choose.

